        {
            "texttype":"Online",
            "textpurpose":"Description",
            "textentryhtml":"In-folded tubular rim, pinched to form a trefoil mouth; short cylindrical neck;\r\ncylindrical body with overhanging shoulder; flat bottom, slightly indented at center. Body covered with mold-blown vertical ribs. Fine thread wound spirally around body and on bottom. Thick coil wound spirally twice around the neck. Vertical,\r\nangular, coil handle from shoulder to rim, with thumb rest at top. The whole vessel is badly executed and lopsided.",
